[{"answer":"Hello Dr Green,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/1.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm here to talk to you about my work placement.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yes, it's Holly, isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/4.mp3"},{"answer":"So, which work placement have you chosen?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/5.mp3"},{"answer":"I decided to go for the Orion Stadium placement.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/6.mp3"},{"answer":"The event I'll be managing is one where I'm helping to set up a sports competition for primary school children.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Yup. That's always a popular placement,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/8.mp3"},{"answer":"even though it can be tougher than you think working with children.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/9.mp3"},{"answer":"I know, but it's the fresh air that attracts me,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/10.mp3"},{"answer":"organising something indoors doesn't have the same appeal,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/11.mp3"},{"answer":"even though it might be fun.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/12.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, so obviously safety's going to be one of your key concerns for this event.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I've already thought about that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/14.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll need to make sure none of the equipment's damaged.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah well, you'll be working with schools, so the equipment will be their responsibility.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/16.mp3"},{"answer":"However, the grounds and what goes on there will be yours.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh I see,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/18.mp3"},{"answer":"that'll include keeping everyone within the boundary once they're in their kit and on the field?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Exactly,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/20.mp3"},{"answer":"you'll need to inspect areas like changing rooms as well for anything someone can trip over,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/21.mp3"},{"answer":"but your main priority will be not to lose anyone!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/23.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll need staff to help with that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/24.mp3"},{"answer":"And don't forget about the spectators.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I was thinking that many of them will be parents, who could help run the event.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/26.mp3"},{"answer":"I wouldn't rely on that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/27.mp3"},{"answer":"They'll be more interested in filming their children than volunteering.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/28.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll need to make sure they don't interfere with events doing that!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/29.mp3"},{"answer":"And that's not always easy,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/30.mp3"},{"answer":"especially when a proud parent's trying to get a snap of their child","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/31.mp3"},{"answer":"and you want them to move elsewhere.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/32-2023-02-10-20-25-36.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/33.mp3"},{"answer":"What about the scheduling?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/34.mp3"},{"answer":"With sporting events there are all sorts of things that can alter the timetable,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/35.mp3"},{"answer":"like rain, for instance, though so far, we've always been lucky with that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, and I was thinking about what to do if someone got hurt as well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/37.mp3"},{"answer":"I know that last year that caused a terrible delay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/38.mp3"},{"answer":"You have to be prepared for such things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh. What if a match ends in a draw,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/40.mp3"},{"answer":"do you let the teams keep going until someone wins?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/41.mp3"},{"answer":"That'll be up to you,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/42.mp3"},{"answer":"and again, you need to plan for it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, the aim of your work placement is to give you the opportunity to develop the skills that an events manager needs.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/45.mp3"},{"answer":"So, let's talk about those a bit.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I think my communication skills are pretty good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/47.mp3"},{"answer":"I can talk on the phone to people and book venues and that kind of thing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Good, just remember it isn't only about what you say.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/49.mp3"},{"answer":"If you meet someone face-to-face and want to persuade them to be a sponsor, for example...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I'll dress up for that! Sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's go on to think about your organisational skills.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/53.mp3"},{"answer":"You're working in a very people-based industry","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/54.mp3"},{"answer":"and that means things won't always go to plan.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/55.mp3"},{"answer":"I guess it's being prepared to make changes that matters.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/56.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/57.mp3"},{"answer":"You may have to make an on-the-spot change to a timetable because of a problem you hadn't anticipated...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/58.mp3"},{"answer":"...just do it! OK","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/59.mp3"},{"answer":"How's your time management these days?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/60.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm working on it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/61.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm certainly better when I have a deadline, which is why this work suits me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, but it's how you respond as that deadline approaches!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/63.mp3"},{"answer":"I know I've got to look calm even if I'm in a panic.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Just think to yourself,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/65.mp3"},{"answer":"no one must know I'm under pressure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, even though I'm multi-tasking like crazy!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Another skill that events managers need is creativity.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Often your client has what we call the 'big picture' idea,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/69.mp3"},{"answer":"but it's up to the events manager to think of all the fine points that go to making it work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, so I need to listen carefully to that idea and then fill in all the gaps.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/71.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/72.mp3"},{"answer":"And you'll have a team working under you,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/73.mp3"},{"answer":"so another key skill is leadership.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Your team may have lots of ideas too,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/75.mp3"},{"answer":"but you've got to make the ultimate choices.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Do we have refreshments inside or out, for example?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/77.mp3"},{"answer":"Isn't it better to be democratic?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/78.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a nice idea, but you have the ultimate responsibility.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/79.mp3"},{"answer":"So, believe in what you think best.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/80.mp3"},{"answer":"Be prepared to say 'yes', that's a good idea but it won't work here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/81.mp3"},{"answer":"I see what you mean.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/82.mp3"},{"answer":"What about the networking side of things?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/83.mp3"},{"answer":"I know it's an area that a lot of students worry about","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/84.mp3"},{"answer":"because we don't have much experience to offer others.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/85.mp3"},{"answer":"But even without it, you can still be an interesting person with useful ideas.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/86.mp3"},{"answer":"And the more people you impress, the better.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/87.mp3"},{"answer":"I guess that will help me when I apply for a real job.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/88.mp3"},{"answer":"Exactly, think ahead, remember what your ambitions are and keep them in mind.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/89.mp3"},{"answer":"Definitely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-3-2022-12-26-23-49-24/90.mp3"}]
